cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the TIC 214311908 candidate analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "Exoplanet transit search in TESS M dwarfs"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that searches one TESS sector of QLP light curves for transiting planets around
  M dwarfs within 100 pc: detrending (wotan), transit search (TLS), automated vetting,
  cross-match against known objects, injection-recovery calibration, and automated follow-up
  (multi-sector repetition, PRF fit of difference images, MCMC transit fit, TRICERATOPS).
  Applied to sector 104, it recovers all 9 known transiting planets in the target list and
  yields one new candidate, TIC 214311908 (P = 5.6915 d, Rp = 4.9 R_Earth).
authors:
